# Wiktionary morphology layer — 87MB, regenerate locally with
# `pipeline/tool_4a_build_morphology_layer.py`. The kaikki source dump is
# committed under Data/Spanish/Senses/wiktionary/, so this file is fully
# reproducible and doesn't need to be in source.
Data/Spanish/layers/morphology.json

